2026-06-02 19:22:29.378 [TestNG-tests-1] INFO  core.controller.MobileUIController - check for external mixing poor hot water no fault codes boiler looks to be working properly maybe only one tap affected 10 this could be a faulty mixer tap or shower passing cold water into the hot supply after the boiler there are a couple of ways to check for this which we will run through here method 2 is to measure the temperature of the hot water pipe below the boiler and compair it to the temperature of the water leaving the problem tap 10 step 1 10 measure the temperature of the hot water pipe at the boiler record the result of the temperature measured 10 step 2 10 run the hot water tap untill the temperature stableases then measure the temperature of the water at the tap record the result of the temperature measured 10 step 3 10 compare the two readings the temperature at the tap should be similar to the output from the boiler if the temperature at the tap is significantly cooler than at the appliance this would indicate that external mixing is occurring it is sometimes possible to hear the faulty valve passing go round all of the mixers and listen for water flow if pracical isolate the suspect valve and restore the cold supply to the boiler to confirm vl 20ecotec 20pro 2030 20hep isv under 20boiler tap telegan 20temp 20probe telegan 20temp 20probe1 arrowrlup 2017 v6
