2026-06-15 16:13:00.407 [TestNG-tests-1] INFO  core.controller.MobileUIController - xsol system guide system selection select a system from the list below 10 the selected system will display showing valve positions and a short description 10 10 then click the start button to continue 10 y plan system s plan system gravity system c plan system c plan plus system m plan system w plan system with priority switch the w plan heating system a precursor to the y plan system is a hot water priority system meaning the heating will not circulate until the temperature of the hot water has reached its set point similar to the y plan system it has one three port motorised valve which diverts the water flow to the heating or hot water circuits but unlike the y plan can not provide both at the same time this system type is often fitted with a priority switch to alter which circuit heats up first for more information on this setup see the 10 w plan with priority switch option jun 2013 v4 0 w plandescription
