2026-10-12 15:10:55.203 [TestNG-tests-1] INFO  core.controller.mobile.MobileUIController - before ordering a pcb 2017 v2 before ordering a pcb circuit board for an appliance have you followed all the tests in correctly 10 xsol is designed to diagnose every function of every component and does this by defining test scenarios and setting a known appliance state therefore if any test has been skipped or guessed the diagnosis will be incorrect and will often default to the pcb circuit board it is important that you ensure that you have carried out all tests correctly following the instructions given on the test page if you have used the sequence options for quick xsol diagnosis 10 have you selected the correct point in the model check any jumpers or potentiometers are in the correct position and any software settings are made following the instructions 10 10 are all leads firmly connected to the correct terminals check any pcb fuses are there any obvious reasons the pcb has failed 10 e g water leaks inside the appliance 10 damaged harness 10 other components failures such as fan or gas valve ensure any issues have been rectified before fitting a new pcb if you find any xsol diagnoses that can be improved or enhanced then please contact us to give xsol feedback yammer contact diaglab britishgas co uk diagnostics laboratory phone 722429 manufacturers claim that 90 of pcb circuit boards returned under warranty are not faulty testing in the diagnostics lab has shown that over 95 of isar pcb circuit boards returned under warranty and 50 of non warranty pcb circuit boards were not faulty click here for ideal pcb guide pcbs and static read this first gw 20energysaver 20379239 20pcb 201 xsol 20logo 202blue 20bmp 2075 1outwhite diaglabverticalwatermark
